{
  "note": "Item 09. Per act of act-api.schema.json: target kinds, required string args with their values, required numbers, flags, gates (alternatives; each holds growth points per axis, any one of `talents`, a phase), the pool paid on acceptance, secret (no witnesses), once (once per waking), via (the verb the act calls). Gate numbers from act-api.md section 2 where it gives one; reveal Lore 5, the build and sponsor numbers and every pool cost are runner-set. Acts that existed before item 09 keep their old gates (miracle pays in acts.cpp, spells in constants.json spells, demand in demand_knowledge).",
